0..75 Comment "// The twin of `model/layouts/ribbit-list.gandr`: a layout is admitted only"
76..155 Comment "// by an equivalence with the list (vault:01a178aa-6cd7-7ac2-a049-ee4124ad5576,"
156..234 Comment "// § layouts-ribbit), so a layout that loses elements is refused at its round"
235..308 Comment "// trip, and `equiv` decides no round trip over a type that holds itself."
